# A Simple 2-Minute Interview Summary

If interviewer says “Give quick overview”:

> “A ChatGPT-like app consists of client apps communicating with backend APIs through a gateway. The backend orchestrates prompts, retrieves conversation context and external knowledge via vector search, and sends the final prompt to GPU-based LLM inference servers. Responses are streamed token-by-token back to the client using SSE/WebSockets. The system relies heavily on Redis caching, distributed databases, vector stores, autoscaling GPU clusters, moderation pipelines, and observability systems to achieve low latency, scalability, and reliability at massive scale.”

That answer is strong enough for many SDE-2 interviews.
